! Input for the BIG 3D integration test (test/testMPIIntegration3DBig.pf).
!
! Derived from the shortCSE example, inputs/simple/3D/shortCSE/shCSE.in, kept at
! the example's physical parameters so the test exercises a realistic
! full-transverse-mesh CSE run rather than a contrived one. The changes from the
! example are the input-file paths (which are resolved relative to build/test/,
! where the test runs), the output cadence -- dialled right down, since the test
! only ever compares the first and last dumps and each full field dump is
! 637 MB -- and iRandSeed.
!
! iRandSeed is what makes this testable at all. Left at its default the beam's
! shot noise is seeded from the system clock, so no two runs agree and no golden
! reference means anything; fixing it pins the noise realisation and the run
! repeats exactly. The particular value is arbitrary.
!
! Resources, measured over two full runs on a 48 GiB Apple M5 Pro with 6 MPI
! ranks (one per performance core):
!
!   field mesh      85 x 85 x 5780  = 41.8M nodes
!   resident memory 1.4-2.0 GB per rank at the end of the run, 9-12 GB total
!   output written  ~1.3 GB (2 full field dumps + 2 electron dumps)
!   wall clock      ~8.7 minutes (522 s and 532 s)
!
! Peak memory is not a fixed cost: it grows steadily with the number of
! integration steps taken, roughly 750 MB per rank at 300 steps against 1.4 GB
! at 7500, at any rank count. Budget from the step count, not from a short run.
!
! That is why the test is gated behind PUFFIN_BIG_TESTS as well as being slow —
! see the comments in test/CMakeLists.txt.
!
! For the meaning of each parameter, see the commented header of
! inputs/simple/3D/shortCSE/shCSE.in.

&MDATA
 qOneD                  = .false.
 iNumNodesX             = 85
 iNumNodesY             = 85
 nodesPerLambdar        = 14
 sFModelLengthX         = 44.49088
 sFModelLengthY         = 44.49088
 sFModelLengthZ2        = 31.0
 iRedNodesX             = 20
 iRedNodesY             = 20
 zundType               = 'helical'
 srho                   = 0.00555
 sgamma_r               = 700.0
 saw                    = 1.0
 lambda_w               = 0.025
 stepsPerPeriod         = 30
 nPeriods               = 250
 seed_file              = 'inputs/3D/seed_file.in'
 beam_file              = 'inputs/3D/shcse_big_beam.in'
 iWriteNthSteps         = 7500
 iWriteIntNthSteps      = 750
 iRandSeed              = 20260810
 /
